# Cloudflare Pages Redirects & Rewrites

# Exact static paths first (most performant)
/advertisers    /advertisers.html 200
/about          /about.html       200
/ads            /index.html       301
/explore        /index.html       301

# Dynamic clean URL rewrites (splats)
/ads/*          /ad.html          200
/advertisers/*  /advertiser.html  200
/advertiser/*   /advertiser.html  200
